I wanted to ask you.

257
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:57,000
Iron body!

258
00:18:01,900 --> 00:18:04,400
Time to suffer, Jinbe.

259
00:18:06,880 --> 00:18:08,440
And last!

260
00:18:25,460 --> 00:18:30,120
Fishman jujitsu, low tide, shoulder throw!

261
00:18:37,820 --> 00:18:39,580
Water shot!

262
00:18:49,700 --> 00:18:51,600
That hurt!

263
00:18:52,300 --> 00:18:54,880
Damn, you're merciless!

264
00:18:59,560 --> 00:19:01,760
Hey, time out!

265
00:19:02,700 --> 00:19:05,876
Pal, can you give me a break
for just one damn minute?

266
00:19:09,780 --> 00:19:13,260
There was this story I heard
when I was behind bars.

267
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,640
Maybe you know it.

268
00:19:15,820 --> 00:19:20,960
As I was being tortured, the guard
mockingly told me to pray for salvation.

269
00:19:21,540 --> 00:19:24,480
Pray to the sun god, Nika.

270
00:19:26,760 --> 00:19:28,717
He's like a hero to slaves.

271
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:33,717
He was a legendary warrior who fought
for freedom in ancient times prophesized

272
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:38,720
to return and liberate the enslaved
I don't know if he really existed,

273
00:19:39,020 --> 00:19:41,737
but they say he would
deliver folks from suffering

274
00:19:41,820 --> 00:19:45,497
with a smile on his face
It was a strange story,

275
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:49,060
but I held on to it in
those seemingly endless days

276
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:54,240
Doesn't matter who just saved me I thought

277
00:19:55,460 --> 00:20:00,777
and what answers do you hope to find
from me i heard a rumor about some

278
00:20:00,860 --> 00:20:06,020
of the sun pirates you used to lead
quite a few of them used to be slaves

279
00:20:10,220 --> 00:20:14,540
the history of fishmen
is a history of slavery

280
00:20:18,060 --> 00:20:23,040
turns out the guard who told me
about nika was later executed

281
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:28,337
I thought they might come for me next,

282
00:20:28,420 --> 00:20:31,479
so I risked everything to
get the hell out of there!

283
00:20:38,620 --> 00:20:41,000
Is it dangerous to speak his name?

284
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:43,080
I can't help but be curious.

285
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:46,740
What are you hiding?
Tell me! Take a pistol!

286
00:20:48,260 --> 00:20:49,090
Spot!

287
00:21:04,620 --> 00:21:07,260
Fishman Toretti, shark grip!

288
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:13,760
I have nothing to tell you!

289
00:21:13,980 --> 00:21:15,500
Do you understand me?

290
00:21:18,220 --> 00:21:19,600
What the hell?

291
00:21:19,840 --> 00:21:21,840
I really struck a nerve, didn't I?

292
00:21:25,580 --> 00:21:28,720
I 'LL CRUSH YOU, MY PISTOL!

293
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:44,600
What's gotten into you?

294
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:49,540
Fishman Karate Secret Art! Oh crap!

295
00:21:53,260 --> 00:21:55,140
Hey, that's my tail!

296
00:21:56,260 --> 00:21:57,460
Demon's Brickness!

297
00:22:11,420 --> 00:22:14,949
You learn your mouth about this
like it's some sort of game!

298
00:22:15,900 --> 00:22:17,577
This is the weight of history!

299
00:22:17,660 --> 00:22:19,360
Do you understand now?
